aji:m023-0028","start":28,"end":30,"surface":"長老","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m023-0035","start":35,"end":37,"surface":"河伯","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m023-0045","start":45,"end":46,"surface":"豹","kind":"person","person_id":"hap_m8c_czz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m023-0055","start":55,"end":57,"surface":"三老","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m023-0058","start":58,"end":60,"surface":"廷掾","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m023-0083","start":83,"end":85,"surface":"河伯","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m023-0106","start":106,"end":109,"surface":"小家女","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m023-0116","start":116,"end":118,"surface":"河伯","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m023-0212","start":212,"end":214,"surface":"巫祝","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m023-0215","start":215,"end":217,"surface":"河伯","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m023-0258","start":258,"end":260,"surface":"河伯","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m023-0276","start":276,"end":279,"surface":"西門豹","kind":"person","person_id":"hap_m8c_czz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m023-0284","start":284,"end":286,"surface":"河伯","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m023-0291","start":291,"end":293,"surface":"三老","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m023-0294","start":294,"end":296,"surface":"巫祝","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m023-0297","start":297,"end":299,"surface":"父老","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-126-huaji","book_id":"b-shiji-126","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji126-huaji"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:p024","text":"至其時，西門豹往會之河上。三老、官屬、豪長者、裏父老皆會，以人民往觀之者三二千人。其巫，老女子也，已年七十。從弟子女十人所，皆衣繒單衣，立大巫后。西門豹曰：「呼河伯婦來，視其好醜。」即將女出帷中，來至前。豹視之，顧謂三老、巫祝、父老曰：「是女子不好，煩大巫嫗為入報河伯，得更求好女，后日送之。」即使吏卒共抱大巫嫗投之河中。有頃，曰：「巫嫗何久也？弟子趣之！」復以弟子一人投河中。有頃，曰：「弟子何久也？復使一人趣之！」復投一弟子河中。凡投三弟子。西門豹曰：「巫嫗弟子是女子也，不能白事，煩三老為入白之。」復投三老河中。西門豹簪筆磬折，向河立待良久。長老、吏傍觀者皆驚恐。西門豹顧曰：「巫嫗、三老不來還，柰之何？」欲復使廷掾與豪長者一人入趣之。皆叩頭，叩頭且破，額血流地，色如死灰。西門豹曰：「諾，且留待之須臾。」須臾，豹曰：「廷掾起矣。狀河伯留客之久，若皆罷去歸矣。」鄴吏民大驚恐，從是以後，不敢復言為河伯娶婦。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"witness_appended_chu_note","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m024-0004","start":4,"end":7,"surface":"西門豹","kind":"person","person_id":"hap_m8c_czz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m024-0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"三老","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m024-0024","start":24,"end":26,"surface":"父老","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m024-0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"其巫","kind":"person","person_id":"msq_cc5_was","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m024-0044","start":44,"end":47,"surface":"老女子","kind":"person","person_id":"msq_cc5_was","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m024-0055","start":55,"end":57,"surface":"弟子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m024-0069","start":69,"end":71,"surface":"大巫","kind":"person","person_id":"msq_cc5_was","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m024-0073","start":73,"end":76,"surface":"西門豹","kind":"person","person_id":"hap_m8c_czz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m024-0080","start":80,"end":83,"surface":"河伯婦","kind":"person","per